    narr:narration """The current status of the [Kestrelwood spectrograph](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_3) centers on its recent technical validation. As of July 15, 2026, the instrument is [calibrated at 88.4 MHz](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_1), a figure that has been [verified against June reference plates](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_4). This process is framed within a broader organizational commitment to [calibration verification as the basis for instrument trust](narr:Narrative_InstrumentCalibrationVerification), emphasizing that technical reliability is contingent upon checking performance against independent data. The current state of the instrument is defined by its [stability across the full observing band](narr:Expr_1ForgetLifecycleTarget_2), establishing a baseline of competence for ongoing operations.""" ;
